 boards alongside specs and tickets",Slack:"Connect your Slack account to quickly find and reference channel conversations while you work in Atlassian.",GitHub:"Connect your GitHub account to make it easier to find, share, and collaborate on PRs, issues, commits, and repos.","Azure DevOps":"Connect your Azure DevOps account to quickly find and link repositories, work items, and pipelines from Atlassian.","Adobe Sign":"Connect your Adobe Sign account so you can quickly find, share, and reference agreements while you work in Atlassian.","Adobe XD":"Connect your Adobe XD account to surface key design files and prototypes where your team plans and tracks work.",Dovetail:"Connect your Dovetail account to bring research notes and insights into view when you're making product decisions.",Lucid:"Connect your Lucid account to make diagrams and documents easy to find and reference in issues, pages, and chats.",Miro:"Connect your Miro account to quickly pull in brainstorming boards and plans wherever your team is coordinating work.",Mural:"Connect your Mural account so you can search and share whiteboards directly from Atlassian tools.",Zeplin:"Connect your Zeplin account to quickly surface specs and design assets right where implementation work happens.","Aha!":"Connect your Aha! account to quickly surface product features and roadmaps alongside delivery work in Atlassian.",Asana:"Connect your Asana account so you can find and link tasks and subtasks without leaving Atlassian.",ClickUp:"Connect your ClickUp account to search and attach tasks and lists right where your team collaborates.",Monday:"Connect your Monday account to bring important boards and items into view when planning and tracking work.",Todoist:"Connect your Todoist account so you can find and link personal tasks directly from Atlassian.",GitLab:"Connect your GitLab account so you can quickly locate and reference repositories alongside specs and tickets.",PagerDuty:"Connect your PagerDuty account so you can qui